      <file>src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Communication/Engine/Rungs/ParticipantCorrelationRung.cs (`QueryContactByEmailAsync` — the resolution the write reuses; confirms the resolved-vs-unresolved shape)</file>
      <file>projects/messaging-communication-app-r2/spec.md (FR-08 locked schema + §New-Components + §ADR Tensions ADR-034 path C)</file>
      <file>.claude/adr/ADR-034-user-record-membership.md (the tuple-intent this junction complies with)</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="FR-08">Create EXACTLY the 6 locked fields + primary `sprk_name`: `sprk_communication` (required Lookup→sprk_communication), `sprk_systemuser` (nullable Lookup→systemuser), `sprk_contact` (nullable Lookup→contact), `sprk_role` (Choice {From,To,Cc,Bcc}), `sprk_addresstext` (Text), `sprk_isresolved` (Boolean). Do NOT add, drop, or rename fields.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec Q-A">Message grain ONLY — the parent lookup is `sprk_communication`. MUST NOT add a thread-grain lookup or thread-grain rows (thread participation is derived by rollup).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-034 (path C, spec §ADR Tensions)">Two typed nullable person lookups (`sprk_systemuser`/`sprk_contact`), NOT the Guid+type tuple and NOT a polymorphic lookup — only 2 targets, so typed lookups honor ADR-034's intent (typed identity, no text-name matching). The exactly-one-set invariant is enforced by the write (050), not a schema constraint.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec Q-D">Support unresolved external rows at the schema level: both person lookups nullable, `sprk_addresstext` present, `sprk_isresolved` Boolean — a row with both person lookups null + addresstext set + isresolved=false MUST be creatable.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Consume task 001's audit — confirm NO junction exists yet; assign the `sprk_role` integers per the 001 plan (verify via MCP before assignment). Do NOT recreate anything.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-027">Author the junction into the project's managed solution per subscription-isolation/solution conventions; no direct prod-only unmanaged changes.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Schema ONLY. No capture/send-time write (that is 050), no `participant=` join (that is 051), no BFF code. The ADR-034 tension is authored by task 004, not here.</constraint>
  </constraints>

